  <aside class="career-timeline__current" aria-label="Current phase of work">
    <div>
      <span>Current phase</span>
      <strong>
        <span>Development</span>
        <span><i>→</i> Integration</span>
        <span><i>→</i> Verification</span>
      </strong>
    </div>
    <p>
      Leading safety-critical mechanical and fluid hardware through requirements, interfaces,
